# blinky test box: the box user is the box's administrator, with passwordless
# sudo for everything. The box is a dedicated dev/test machine driven by Claude
# sessions in tmux, which install packages and manage services and scripts
# without a password prompt (owner, 2026-10-27). It also covers the flash path's
# sudo calls (uhubctl, /mnt/uf2-* mounts, udisks2, tools/usb_reset.py).
# Generated by scripts/testbox/setup.sh from sudoers.in; edit that, not this.

@USER@ ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
